      "text": "Yes, I am."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": "00:17:15.730",
      "end": "00:21:43.340",
      "text": "Okay, thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": "00:21:43.340",
      "end": "00:22:14.380",
      "text": "Good afternoon, everyone."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": "00:22:14.380",
      "end": "00:22:17.560",
      "text": "I will call this meeting to order."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": "00:22:17.560",
      "end": "00:22:20.110",
      "text": "The city of London is situated on the traditional lands"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": "00:22:20.110",
      "end": "00:22:22.360",
      "text": "of the Anishinaabek, Haudenosaunee,"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": "00:22:22.360",
      "end": "00:22:24.500",
      "text": "Lenapawik, and Adawandran."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": "00:22:24.500",
      "end": "00:22:26.910",
      "text": "We honor and respect the history, languages,"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": "00:22:26.910",
      "end": "00:22:29.040",
      "text": "and culture of the diverse indigenous people"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": "00:22:29.040",
      "end": "00:22:31.070",
      "text": "who call this territory home."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": "00:22:31.070",
      "end": "00:22:32.500",
      "text": "The city of London is currently home"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": "00:22:32.500",
      "end": "00:22:35.770",
      "text": "to many First Nations, M\u00e9tis, and Inuit today."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": "00:22:35.770",
      "end": "00:22:38.080",
      "text": "As representatives of the people of the city of London,"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": "00:22:38.080",
      "end": "00:22:40.630",
      "text": "we are grateful to have the opportunity to work"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": "00:22:40.630",
      "end": "00:22:42.860",
      "text": "and live in this territory."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": "00:22:42.860",
      "end": "00:22:45.630",
      "text": "The city of London is committed to making every effort"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": "00:22:45.630",
      "end": "00:22:48.710",
      "text": "to provide alternate formats and communication supports"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": "00:22:48.710",
      "end": "00:22:51.060",
      "text": "for meetings upon request."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": "00:22:51.060",
      "end": "00:22:52.840",
      "text": "To make a request specific to this meeting,"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": "00:22:52.840",
      "end": "00:22:57.800",
      "text": "please contact CWC at london.ca, or 519-661-2489,"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": "00:22:57.800",
      "end": "00:23:01.760",
      "text": "extension 2425."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": "00:23:01.760",
      "end": "00:23:06.170",
      "text": "So this is the eighth meeting of the Civic Works Committee."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": "00:23:06.170",
      "end": "00:23:10.050",
      "text": "In chambers, we have Councillor McAllister,"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": "00:23:10.050",
      "end": "00:23:13.690",
      "text": "Councillor Cuddy, Councillor Trozzo, and myself."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": "00:23:13.690",
      "end": "00:23:15.810",
      "text": "And online, we have Councillor Van Neerberg"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": "00:23:15.810",
      "end": "00:23:17.120",
      "text": "in joining us."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": "00:23:17.120",
      "end": "00:23:19.710",
      "text": "And we also have two visiting Councillors today."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": "00:23:19.710",
      "end": "00:23:23.470",
      "text": "We have Councillor Frank and Councillor Pribble."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": "00:23:23.470",
      "end": "00:23:24.450",
      "text": "Welcome everyone."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": "00:23:24.450",
      "end": "00:23:25.900",
      "text": "I will go to item number one,"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": "00:23:25.900",
      "end": "00:23:29.630",
      "text": "disclosures of pecuniary interest."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": "00:23:29.630",
      "end": "00:23:30.450",
      "text": "Councillor Trozzo."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": "00:23:30.450",
      "end": "00:23:33.780",
      "text": "Yes, I'm going to declare a pecuniary interest"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": "00:23:33.780",
      "end": "00:23:39.230",
      "text": "on item 0.4 regarding the Brookdale Dyke"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": "00:23:39.230",
      "end": "00:23:41.050",
      "text": "on account of the fact that I live"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": "00:23:41.050",
      "end": "00:23:43.190",
      "text": "in the immediate vicinity."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": "00:23:43.190",
      "end": "00:23:47.460",
      "text": "I own property and reside in the immediate vicinity."
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": "00:23:47.460",
      "end": "00:23:49.040",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": "00:23:49.040",
      "end": "00:23:53.290",
      "text": "So what we'll do is we will deal with items 2.1,"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": "00:23:53.290",
      "end": "00:23:57.210",
      "text": "2.2, and 2.3 under consent first,"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": "00:23:57.210",
      "end": "00:23:59.800",
      "text": "and then we'll deal with 2.4 separate."
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": "00:23:59.800",
      "end": "00:24:03.670",
      "text": "I'm looking for a mover and a seconder for 2.1 through 2.3."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": "00:24:03.670",
      "end": "00:24:06.990",
      "text": "I see Councillor Van Neerberg and followed by Councillor Cuddy"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": "00:24:06.990",
      "end": "00:24:09.320",
      "text": "for first and second."
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": "00:24:09.320",
      "end": "00:24:14.230",
      "text": "Any questions or comments about items 2.1 through 2.3?"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": "00:24:14.230",
      "end": "00:24:19.690",
      "text": "Councillor Pribble."
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": "00:24:19.690",
      "end": "00:24:22.440",
      "text": "Just a quick question through the chair to the staff."
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": "00:24:22.440",
      "end": "00:24:25.780",
      "text": "In regards of the 2.3, the consulting fees,"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": "00:24:25.780",
      "end": "00:24:28.320",
      "text": "I just want to make sure they understood it correctly."
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": "00:24:28.320",
      "end": "00:24:33.290",
      "text": "The 83 ask for 83,000 increase for the consulting,"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": "00:24:33.290",
      "end": "00:24:37.260",
      "text": "but then it states that it will be reimbursed"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": "00:24:37.260",
      "end": "00:24:38.970",
      "text": "by the contractor."
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": "00:24:38.970",
      "end": "00:24:43.490",
      "text": "Is it the same amount, 83,000 or is it going to be less?"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": "00:24:43.490",
      "end": "00:24:47.910",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": "00:24:47.910",
      "end": "00:24:50.670",
      "text": "Thank you, I'll go to Ms. Chair."
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": "00:24:50.670",
      "end": "00:24:51.480",
      "text": "Thank you Madam Chair."
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": "00:24:51.480",
      "end": "00:24:54.430",
      "text": "I'm going to turn that question over to Ms. Chambers."
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": "00:24:54.430",
      "end": "00:24:55.250",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": "00:24:55.250",
      "end": "00:24:56.080",
      "text": "Ms. Chambers, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": "00:24:56.080",
      "end": "00:24:56.910",
      "text": "Oh, sorry."
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": "00:24:56.910",
      "end": "00:24:59.510",
      "text": "Through the chair, the total 83,000 will be covered"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": "00:24:59.510",
      "end": "00:25:01.150",
      "text": "by the contractor."
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": "00:25:01.150",
      "end": "00:25:02.290",
      "text": "This report is effectively,"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": "00:25:02.290",
      "end": "00:25:04.550",
      "text": "we have to increase the purchase order to the consultant."
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": "00:25:04.550",
      "end": "00:25:06.930",
      "text": "So it's a bit of a flow through."
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": "00:25:06.930",
      "end": "00:25:09.090",
      "text": "So we'll get the money from the contractor"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": "00:25:09.090",
      "end": "00:25:13.590",
      "text": "and then we can increase and pay the consultant."
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": "00:25:13.590",
      "end": "00:25:15.100",
      "text": "Thank you, additional questions?"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": "00:25:15.100",
      "end": "00:25:15.930",
      "text": "Just a follow up."
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": "00:25:15.930",
      "end": "00:25:16.950",
      "text": "So it's going to be the same amount."
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": "00:25:16.950",
      "end": "00:25:18.420",
      "text": "The only thing is process wise."
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": "00:25:18.420",
      "end": "00:25:20.200",
      "text": "We have to increase it, approve it."
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": "00:25:20.200",
      "end": "00:25:24.880",
      "text": "And even by the project, it's going to be same amount."
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": "00:25:24.880",
      "end": "00:25:29.020",
      "text": "Through the chair, that is correct."
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": "00:25:29.020",
      "end": "00:25:31.110",
      "text": "Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": "00:25:31.110",
      "end": "00:25:31.930",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": "00:25:31.930",
      "end": "00:25:38.470",
      "text": "Any additional questions on 2.1 through 2.3?"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": "00:25:38.470",
      "end": "00:25:44.670",
      "text": "Seeing none, I'll call the question."
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": "00:25:44.670",
      "end": "00:25:58.400",
      "text": "Vote yes."
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": "00:25:58.400",
      "end": "00:26:03.320",
      "text": "Closing the vote, the motion passes five to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": "00:26:03.320",
      "end": "00:26:04.160",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": "00:26:04.160",
      "end": "00:26:06.770",
      "text": "We'll look to deal with item number 2.4,"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": "00:26:06.770",
      "end": "00:26:09.660",
      "text": "which is the roughdale-dike disaster mitigation"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": "00:26:09.660",
      "end": "00:26:13.070",
      "text": "and adaption funding contribution agreement."
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": "00:26:13.070",
      "end": "00:26:18.660",
      "text": "I'll note that Councillor Trozzo has left the room."
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": "00:26:18.660",
      "end": "00:26:20.000",
      "text": "Sorry, he's sitting in the back of the room,"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": "00:26:20.000",
      "end": "00:26:21.660",
      "text": "but not participating in the conversation."
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": "00:26:21.660",
      "end": "00:26:26.570",
      "text": "And I'll look to a committee for a mover and a seconder,"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": "00:26:26.570",
      "end": "00:26:27.590",
      "text": "moved by Councillor Cuddy,"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": "00:26:27.590",
      "end": "00:26:29.120",
      "text": "seconded by Councillor McAllister."
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": "00:26:29.120",
      "end": "00:26:38.720",
      "text": "Any questions or comments?"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": "00:26:38.720",
      "end": "00:26:42.170",
      "text": "Hey, seeing none, I will look,"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": "00:26:42.170",
      "end": "00:27:04.930",
      "text": "I'll open the vote for this item."
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": "00:27:04.930",
      "end": "00:27:09.840",
      "text": "Closing the vote, the motion passes four to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": "00:27:09.840",
      "end": "00:27:12.350",
      "text": "Okay, thank you for moving along quite quickly."
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": "00:27:12.350",
      "end": "00:27:13.940",
      "text": "We have no scheduled items."
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": "00:27:13.940",
      "end": "00:27:15.620",
      "text": "We have one item for direction,"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": "00:27:15.620",
      "end": "00:27:18.320",
      "text": "which is in your package as an added"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": "00:27:18.320",
      "end": "00:27:21.310",
      "text": "and it was a letter from Councillor Frank."
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start": "00:27:21.310",
      "end": "00:27:25.730",
      "text": "The letter pertains to the climate action"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start": "00:27:25.730",
      "end": "00:27:27.040",
      "text": "and sustainable growth,"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": "00:27:27.040",
      "end": "00:27:31.630",
      "text": "specifically looking at a strategy on zero plastic waste."
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": "00:27:31.630",
      "end": "00:27:35.130",
      "text": "It includes three items in a motion."
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start": "00:27:35.130",
      "end": "00:27:37.280",
      "text": "A, that civic administration be directed"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start": "00:27:37.280",
      "end": "00:27:38.470",
      "text": "to provide written feedback"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start": "00:27:38.470",
      "end": "00:27:41.360",
      "text": "on the proposed plastic regulatory framework"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start": "00:27:41.360",
      "end": "00:27:44.300",
      "text": "and technical document through the federal government process"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start": "00:27:44.300",
      "end": "00:27:47.430",
      "text": "by May 18th, 2023 deadline."
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start": "00:27:47.430",
      "end": "00:27:49.340",
      "text": "A, that civic administration be directed"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start": "00:27:49.340",
      "end": "00:27:51.290",
      "text": "to provide a copy of the written submission"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start": "00:27:51.290",
      "end": "00:27:53.760",
      "text": "to civic works committee at a future meeting."
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "start": "00:27:53.760",
      "end": "00:27:56.400",
      "text": "And C, the civic administration be directed"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "start": "00:27:56.400",
      "end": "00:27:58.630",
      "text": "to provide a copy of the written submission"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start": "00:27:58.630",
      "end": "00:28:01.220",
      "text": "to the environmental stewardship and action"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start": "00:28:01.220",
      "end": "00:28:02.730",
      "text": "community advisory committee"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "start": "00:28:02.730",
      "end": "00:28:05.330",
      "text": "for information as part of ongoing discussions"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "start": "00:28:05.330",
      "end": "00:28:08.560",
      "text": "dealing with the blue bin transition in London."
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "start": "00:28:08.560",
      "end": "00:28:10.190",
      "text": "I'll look for a mover and seconder"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "start": "00:28:10.190",
      "end": "00:28:11.630",
      "text": "to put this item on the floor"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "start": "00:28:11.630",
      "end": "00:28:12.700",
      "text": "and then to Councillor Frank"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "start": "00:28:12.700",
      "end": "00:28:14.740",
      "text": "if she has any further comment."
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "start": "00:28:14.740",
      "end": "00:28:19.950",
      "text": "Councillor McAllister and Councillor Cutty, thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "start": "00:28:19.950",
      "end": "00:28:21.700",
      "text": "And now that that item is moved and seconded,"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "start": "00:28:21.700",
      "end": "00:28:25.870",
      "text": "would anyone like to speak to it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "start": "00:28:25.870",
      "end": "00:28:27.920",
      "text": "Councillor Frank."
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "start": "00:28:27.920",
      "end": "00:28:29.320",
      "text": "Thank you and thank you for having me"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "start": "00:28:29.320",
      "end": "00:28:30.770",
      "text": "as a guest at your committee."
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "start": "00:28:30.770",
      "end": "00:28:34.390",
      "text": "I was made aware of this opportunity"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "start": "00:28:34.390",
      "end": "00:28:36.990",
      "text": "to provide feedback to the federal government last week,"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "start": "00:28:36.990",
      "end": "00:28:39.180",
      "text": "which is kind of widespread last minute,"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "start": "00:28:39.180",
      "end": "00:28:40.980",
      "text": "but there is only a one month window,"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "start": "00:28:40.980",
      "end": "00:28:43.500",
      "text": "which is why I'm coming and hoping"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "start": "00:28:43.500",
      "end": "00:28:45.740",
      "text": "that we can move this along and work with staff"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "start": "00:28:45.740",
      "end": "00:28:48.330",
      "text": "to provide this feedback by May 18th,"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "start": "00:28:48.330",
      "end": "00:28:49.610",
      "text": "which is a deadline."
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "start": "00:28:49.610",
      "end": "00:28:51.250",
      "text": "As we've outlined in our strat plan,"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "start": "00:28:51.250",
      "end": "00:28:53.280",
      "text": "we are hoping to move towards a circular economy"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "start": "00:28:53.280",
      "end": "00:28:54.680",
      "text": "and a very important part of that"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "start": "00:28:54.680",
      "end": "00:28:57.440",
      "text": "is facing out the use of plastic wherever we can."
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "start": "00:28:57.440",
      "end": "00:28:59.000",
      "text": "And the federal government, I believe,"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "start": "00:28:59.000",
      "end": "00:29:01.190",
      "text": "is working their way through that process as well,"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "start": "00:29:01.190",
      "end": "00:29:03.830",
      "text": "trying to get the entire country"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "start": "00:29:03.830",
      "end": "00:29:05.550",
      "text": "to phase out plastic where possible."
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "start": "00:29:05.550",
      "end": "00:29:09.900",
      "text": "So I know that we have very knowledgeable staff"
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "start": "00:29:09.900",
      "end": "00:29:13.660",
      "text": "on this area and I'm hoping that this committee"
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "start": "00:29:13.660",
      "end": "00:29:16.570",
      "text": "can support directing them to provide that kind of feedback"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "start": "00:29:16.570",
      "end": "00:29:19.530",
      "text": "to the federal government and the federal government,"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "start": "00:29:19.530",
      "end": "00:29:22.520",
      "text": "specifically outlined asking for input"
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "start": "00:29:22.520",
      "end": "00:29:25.320",
      "text": "from municipalities, provinces, and other stakeholder groups."
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "start": "00:29:25.320",
      "end": "00:29:27.920",
      "text": "So I thought this would be an excellent opportunity."
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "start": "00:29:27.920",
      "end": "00:29:29.390",
      "text": "And I'm also not necessarily looking"
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "start": "00:29:29.390",
      "end": "00:29:31.630",
      "text": "for something like too detailed from staff."
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "start": "00:29:31.630",
      "end": "00:29:34.630",
      "text": "I don't want to use up too much of their very valuable time,"
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "start": "00:29:34.630",
      "end": "00:29:37.700",
      "text": "but I do think outlining maybe what London's priorities are"
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "start": "00:29:37.700",
      "end": "00:29:40.380",
      "text": "in relationship to this framework would be really helpful."
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "start": "00:29:40.380",
      "end": "00:29:44.530",
      "text": "So that is why I brought it here."
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "start": "00:29:44.530",
      "end": "00:29:45.360",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "start": "00:29:45.360",
      "end": "00:29:48.890",
      "text": "Any further questions or comments by committee members"
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "start": "00:29:48.890",
      "end": "00:29:52.360",
      "text": "or visiting guests, visiting counselors?"
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "start": "00:29:52.360",
      "end": "00:29:53.540",
      "text": "Councilor Trossa."
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "start": "00:29:53.540",
      "end": "00:29:55.750",
      "text": "Just to thank you for coming and bringing this"
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "start": "00:29:55.750",
      "end": "00:29:59.020",
      "text": "to our attention, it really could have slipped by"
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "start": "00:29:59.020",
      "end": "00:30:01.170",
      "text": "given the very quick deadline."
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "start": "00:30:01.170",
      "end": "00:30:05.390",
      "text": "So thank you again."
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "start": "00:30:05.390",
      "end": "00:30:06.660",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "start": "00:30:06.660",
      "end": "00:30:10.020",
      "text": "Councilor Van Mirbergen."
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "start": "00:30:10.020",
      "end": "00:30:11.000",
      "text": "Thank you, Chair."
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "start": "00:30:11.000",
      "end": "00:30:14.490",
      "text": "I'm wondering if Mr. Stanford might be online"
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "start": "00:30:14.490",
      "end": "00:30:18.490",
      "text": "or present since he is coordinating"
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "start": "00:30:18.490",
      "end": "00:30:21.130",
      "text": "our climate change response."
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "start": "00:30:21.130",
      "end": "00:30:21.950",
      "text": "Yes, thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "start": "00:30:21.950",
      "end": "00:30:24.230",
      "text": "He's here in chambers and Mr. Stanford,"
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "start": "00:30:24.230",
      "end": "00:30:29.070",
      "text": "did you have anything to add?"
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "start": "00:30:29.070",
      "end": "00:30:31.330",
      "text": "Through the chair, is there a question?"
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "start": "00:30:31.330",
      "end": "00:30:34.570",
      "text": "If not, I'm very comfortable with what is being requested here."
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "start": "00:30:34.570",
      "end": "00:30:36.390",
      "text": "It is a file that we've been following now"
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "start": "00:30:36.390",
      "end": "00:30:38.070",
      "text": "for a number of years."
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "start": "00:30:38.070",
      "end": "00:30:39.580",
      "text": "It is something that is very important"
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "start": "00:30:39.580",
      "end": "00:30:41.570",
      "text": "to London and many municipalities."
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "start": "00:30:41.570",
      "end": "00:30:43.710",
      "text": "The very notion of recycled content"
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "start": "00:30:43.710",
      "end": "00:30:46.570",
      "text": "is something long overdue as well as proper labeling."
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "start": "00:30:46.570",
      "end": "00:30:48.110",
      "text": "So what's being proposed here is not only"
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "start": "00:30:48.110",
      "end": "00:30:51.520",
      "text": "going to benefit us, but benefit Canada."
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "start": "00:30:51.520",
      "end": "00:30:54.560",
      "text": "Okay, thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "start": "00:30:54.560",
      "end": "00:30:58.330",
      "text": "Thank you, seeing no further questions or comments,"
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "start": "00:30:58.330",
      "end": "00:31:22.340",
      "text": "I'll call the vote on this item."
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "start": "00:31:22.340",
      "end": "00:31:27.810",
      "text": "Supposing to vote the motion passed, five to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "start": "00:31:27.810",
      "end": "00:31:29.270",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "start": "00:31:29.270",
      "end": "00:31:31.200",
      "text": "There are no deferred matters"
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "start": "00:31:31.200",
      "end": "00:31:34.480",
      "text": "and I've not been made aware of any additional business."
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "start": "00:31:34.480",
      "end": "00:31:37.590",
      "text": "Item number six is adjournment,"
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "start": "00:31:37.590",
      "end": "00:31:40.430",
      "text": "looking for a mover and a seconder to adjourn."
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "start": "00:31:40.430",
      "end": "00:31:43.160",
      "text": "And we've got Councilor McAllister and Councilor Cuddy"
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "start": "00:31:43.160",
      "end": "00:31:49.200",
      "text": "with their hands up and looking for a vote by hand."
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "start": "00:31:49.200",
      "end": "00:31:56.060",
      "text": "Thanks everyone, have a great rest of your day."
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "start": "00:31:56.060",
      "end": "00:32:01.630",
      "text": "I don't know. Was that a record? I don't think so. Take care everyone."
    }
  ],
